"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-romania/"
"issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been "
"reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and "
"welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-romania/issues/new?body=module:"
